BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Housing Help
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260820T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260820T163000
UID:6a1893e290cc4e3a7909bab2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop in and work one-on-one with staff from The Housing Help C
 entre (THHC) to determine your housing needs\, connect you to other govern
 ment services\, and to match you with landlords across the city. THHC work
 s with both individuals and families in the City of Toronto to find and ma
 intain affordable\, safe housing.\nThe Housing Help Centre can be contacte
 d at 416-285-8070 or at shhc.ca
LOCATION:Cedarbrae\, Lobby
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a1893e290cc4e3a7909bab2
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
